bramble (1203): panel sleep on display off: DCS 28/10 after the fade, 11/29 at power on,
through the brightness command DMA; autorefresh paused while asleep. sweetpanelsleep=0 turns it off.

diff --git a/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetFramebuffer.cpp b/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetFramebuffer.cpp
index 8358606..60056b6 100644
--- a/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetFramebuffer.cpp
